output said "COMPLETENESS GRANTS ... counts as an EXAMINED negative ...
python: telnetlib from comm.yaml [CLI flag]" for a grant load_catalog had
withheld. The verdict was unaffected; the disclosure was false.

One partition (_partition_completeness_grants) now runs over every origin.
The withheld block in the text rendering also names each file's origin, as
the applied block does (shared _grant_origin_label). The module and
catalog_provenance docstrings, reworded in the 2026-10-10 audit to describe
the gap, describe the fixed behaviour again.

